{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39292","headline":"九江逢卢员外 · 韦庄","name":"九江逢卢员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年风月宿琴堂，大媚僊山近帝乡。\n别後几沾新雨露，乱来犹记旧篇章。\n陶潜岂是铜符吏，田凤终爲锦帐郎。\n莫怪相逢倍惆怅，九江烟月似潇湘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}